WEBVTT

00:00.590 --> 00:03.640
Dharajau ama pakhare gotie bruta achhi, au sehi bruta re

00:03.640 --> 00:05.280
diameter achhi.

00:05.280 --> 00:09.080
Diameter ta tanuchhi.

00:09.080 --> 00:09.760
Asha karichhu bhala drawing hela.

00:09.760 --> 00:12.580
Eita heuchhi bruta ta diagrameter tiye.

00:14.700 --> 00:16.110
Seita diameter ti.

00:16.110 --> 00:19.220
Dharajau mo pakhare gotiye tribhuja achhi, jahara gotiye bahu heuchhi bruta ra diameter ti.

00:19.220 --> 00:26.040
ebong sehi bahura biparita kona ra bindu ti, bruta re rahuchhi.

00:28.960 --> 00:34.200
Tenu sehi kona ti bruta ra upare rahichhi.

00:35.260 --> 00:38.020
tenu sei tribhuja ti epari dekha jauchhi.

00:38.020 --> 00:44.160
Tribhuja ti epari dekha jauchhi.

00:44.160 --> 00:47.170
Ei video re mun kana dekheiba ku chahunchhi je

00:47.170 --> 00:50.700
ehi tribhuja ti gotiye right angle tribhuja heba.

00:54.290 --> 00:57.040
90 degree bahu ta sehi diameter ra biparita pate rahiba.

00:58.550 --> 01:00.340
Mun ebei seita ku semiti kahibi nahi karana taha hele seita fun au rahiba nahi.

01:02.140 --> 01:05.070
Ebe dekha jan âme kemiti seita dekhei pariba.

01:14.830 --> 01:15.720
tenu dekha jan

01:15.720 --> 01:18.950
dharajau je eita heuchhi bhiatara kona tiye.

01:18.950 --> 01:22.760
eita ku theta boli kahiba.

01:22.760 --> 01:25.070
ebe dhara jau se seita bruta ta center boli.

01:27.370 --> 01:30.190
taha hele, ei kona ti heba central kona.

01:30.190 --> 01:32.620
Mun au gotiye kona draw karuchhi, thi eithi.

01:32.620 --> 01:33.460
au gotiye line tike draw karuchhi.

01:33.460 --> 01:35.130
Ei ta central kona heba, thik eita.

01:35.130 --> 01:38.190
Eita radius heba.

01:38.190 --> 01:40.070
Eita heuchhi sei radius ti. Actually ei distance ta same.

01:41.230 --> 01:44.480
Kintu âme thik achhi agaru dekhu thilu je,

01:44.480 --> 01:48.710
ei kona, ei bhitara kona ti, ei bruta ansha bhitare rahihi.

01:52.420 --> 01:55.850
Bhitara angle jeita e
